    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11116" root="خفض" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ فِى حَالِ خَفْضَةٍ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالِ رِفْعَةٍ</span> [<i>He is in a
state of abasement</i> and <i>in a state of elevation:</i>
or perhaps the word <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خفضة</span> should be written
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِفْضة</span>, to agree in form with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِفْعَة</span>, and because in
itself denoting a state]. (A.)

